      "description": "GD&T feature control frame per ASME Y14.5. Geometric type covers all 14 ASME-defined characteristics: form (3) / orientation (3) / location (3) / runout (2) / profile (2) / +1 composite. Material condition modifiers: M (MMC) / L (LMC) / S (RFS).",
